available: arch != "x86_32"
synopsis:
  "Erase the constructors of annotated type declarations after derivers run"
description: """
Marking a type declaration with [@@delete_constructors_after_deriving] makes
the ppx replace its type kind with an abstract one (this "deletes" the part
of a declaration that defines variant constructors or record fields, but not
the part of the declaration that indicates the type aliases another). This lets
derivers see the constructors of a declaration whose kind the compiler would
reject, such as for types-containing-[any] narrowed to a specific layout.
"""
